From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: annotate unmapped graph semantics

Generated by tools/skippy-stage-rewriter from compiler-proven builder
shapes. Auxiliary sidecars and whole-model multi-domain graphs are proven
separately and remain outside the primary decoder stage interval.

---
diff --git a/src/models/arctic.cpp b/src/models/arctic.cpp
index 1a170f085612251b66bd099ab86dafc3b6a583b8..89b98400c7c57f797eec5f479c3b88844933e7c2 100644
